  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0: Added Server-Sent Events (SSE) streaming support with three endpoint patterns (NoRequestSseEndpointBase, SseEndpointBase<TRequest>, SseEndpointBase<TRequest, TEventData>). Added NoRequest endpoint variants (NoRequestEndpointBase, NoRequestAsyncEndpointBase) for cleaner GET endpoint APIs. Added ContentType property customization for all endpoint types. Includes keep-alive support, JSON serialization, TypedSseStream<T> for compile-time type safety, and comprehensive documentation.",
